{"id":"00951","root":"uni00951_1","name":{"ja":"井河　扇舟","en":"Igawa Senshu"},"title":{"ja":"【BLACK LAGOON】","en":"【Black Lagoon】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【BLACK LAGOON】 井河　扇舟","en":"【Black Lagoon】 Igawa Senshu"},"aliases":["Igawa Ogifune","Igawa Senshuu","Iegawa Senju"],"element":"Superhuman","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin","Poisoner"],"release":"2025-10-31","limited":true,"characterId":999,"profile":{"ja":"旧井河家を率いた井河長老衆が一角。\nアサギの父の姉にあたり、権謀術数に長けた人物として知られた。\n母・葉取星舟に従い、井河家が五車における主導権を握るために暗躍する。\n対魔殺法の達人で、その実力は井河一門最高の近接戦闘能力と称された桃知東洋にも引けを取らないとされた。\n毒手使いであったが、切り落とされ、現在はサイボーグ化した鋼鉄の義手を装着している。\n五車への進攻の際、母に捨て駒とされ、井河アサギに降伏した。","en":"She is a member of the Igawa elder group that led the old Igawa family. She is the sister of Igawa Asagi's father and is known as a person skilled in strategy and tactics. Following her mother, Hatori Seishu, she works behind the scenes for the Igawa family to gain control over Gosha. She is a master of Taimanin killing techniques, and her abilities are said to be on par with Momochi Toyo, who is renowned for her exceptional close combat skills. She was a poison user, but her arm was cut off, and she now wears a cybernetic steel prosthetic. During the invasion of Gosha, she was abandoned by her mother and surrendered to Igawa Asagi."},"illustrator":"さのとしひで","voiceActor":"鶴巻ちとせ","forms":[{"id":"uni00951_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[1040,2080],"sp":[180,180],"atk":[112,224],"def":[130,260],"spd":[55,55],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","2530198"]},{"id":"uni00951_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1680,3360],"sp":[260,260],"atk":[174,348],"def":[210,420],"spd":[55,55],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","2530198","2530199"]},{"id":"uni00951_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[2320,4640],"sp":[360,360],"atk":[236,472],"def":[290,580],"spd":[55,55],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","2530198","2530199"]}],"skills":{"1